emptyOrderTest is test
emptyOrderTest purpose "An order with no lines is refused with emptyOrder"
emptyOrderTest verifies orderTotal rejectsEmpty
emptyOrderTest typeParam none
emptyOrderTest input none
emptyOrderTest output none
emptyOrderTest outputOwner none
emptyOrderTest raises none
emptyOrderTest effect none
emptyOrderTest uses none
emptyOrderTest memory heap true
emptyOrderTest async false
emptyOrderTest maxRecursion none
emptyOrderTest label begin loopKind none
emptyOrderTest label begin within none
emptyOrderTest label inspect loopKind none
emptyOrderTest label inspect within none
emptyOrderTest label rightVariant loopKind none
emptyOrderTest label rightVariant within none
emptyOrderTest label wrongVariant loopKind none
emptyOrderTest label wrongVariant within none
emptyOrderTest label accepted loopKind none
emptyOrderTest label accepted within none
emptyOrderTest let rule immutable PriceRule fullPrice
emptyOrderTest let refused immutable Bool true
emptyOrderTest let acceptedText immutable String "an empty order was priced"
emptyOrderTest let wrongText immutable String "an empty order gave the wrong error"
emptyOrderTest at begin do makeLines
emptyOrderTest at begin do priceOrder
emptyOrderTest at begin branch ifError priceOrder goto inspect else goto accepted
emptyOrderTest at inspect match priceError PricingError
emptyOrderTest at inspect case PricingError.emptyOrder bind none none goto rightVariant
emptyOrderTest at inspect case PricingError.negativeQuantity bind badSku Int64 goto wrongVariant
emptyOrderTest at rightVariant do expectRefused
emptyOrderTest at rightVariant return ok none
emptyOrderTest at wrongVariant do failWrong
emptyOrderTest at wrongVariant return ok none
emptyOrderTest at accepted do failAccepted
emptyOrderTest at accepted return ok none

store is region
store in emptyOrderTest
store strategy arena
store capacity 4096
store released atReturn

makeLines is call
makeLines in emptyOrderTest
makeLines invokes Lines.new
makeLines arg region Region store lend
makeLines out lines Lines
makeLines ownedBy store
makeLines cleanedBy none
makeLines borrows none
makeLines catch none

