priceOrder in emptyOrderTest
priceOrder invokes orderTotal
priceOrder arg lines Lines lines lend
priceOrder arg rule PriceRule rule copy
priceOrder out total Int64
priceOrder ownedBy none
priceOrder cleanedBy none
priceOrder borrows none
priceOrder catch priceError PricingError

